<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-13T07:53:43.104Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:53:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard, Navy and Marine Corps recently repelled five unauthorized Vietnam-flagged fishing vessels near Kota Island and confronted the Chinese research vessel Tan Suo Yi Hao when it entered the area, while also blocking Chinese Coast Guard water-cannon attacks on its ships conducting medical evacuations at Ayungin Shoal and in the Luzon Strait. An upgraded PCG station was opened on Pag-asa Island, strengthening the Philippines' presence on the disputed atoll, and the Philippine Navy conducted passing exercises with Japanese vessels. These actions build on earlier repulsions of foreign vessels and add a new Chinese research vessel confrontation and a new PCG facility. 176 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/article/3370692/marcos-south-china-sea-row-anger-thailand-over-iron-cage-beds-7-asia-highlights?utm_source=rss_feed&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQTVBpZ2dnRFBvdEhlcWRPTFRpWmczRWlqT3NJVXpnZ3g1dUJwSVJadUFJXzVzXzEzZzhib2lHUjg1d201NHA5UG5hTEtWZXYyeWhRZmlIUFJvTWxkVU5scmNtXzIyZ2NEWHdVWHowcXUza2lfb0RITFFyNnk2WUhRendoaXRMdTBpQm5VeUw3MVVtZnBpNnp1YU1aODdOUWw4MHpDdlMteGhFeFR1bFlTQmpYNDI?oc=5&quot;&gt;RealClearDefense&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQVVdPaFlsOEdFLVJiUWVwcENldTZ4ZEFJZHdtRzRodW51eTAzZnZySkZrRTZ5VFB2eTdBdmNCMGZ2di1yMGFoczRQSVBmQnEzSm85QmVUWVVoRjVUcGhNRkgxdDJvZVVKcngyZWJaRWhvSUxCSF9ISWlkcDJsUVVuNWxIZ2xvUVpRVTIzbVp0TWZzZ2lsejljZzV2cTQxUW8xZERaekE2b1R5a1FGaUhzbGVTWXYyd1ZMa2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;RealClearDefense&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://n